{"id":"441689","name":"炒鸡蛋虾仁菠菜汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/441689/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1只"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"90克"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：菠菜、鸡蛋。","img":"images/441689/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁（已清洗）。","img":"images/441689/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鸡蛋打入碗里，加点料酒。","img":"images/441689/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打成蛋液，待用。","img":"images/441689/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将菠菜去根、洗净、捞出。","img":"images/441689/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"折成段，待用。","img":"images/441689/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入蛋液翻炒成块，盛出。","img":"images/441689/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接着，利用炒鸡蛋的油，下入菠菜翻炒一下。","img":"images/441689/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入清水微微煮开。","img":"images/441689/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后，合入炒好的鸡蛋和虾仁。","img":"images/441689/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅动一下煮开，加点盐、鸡精。","img":"images/441689/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"调味翻匀即可。","img":"images/441689/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}